<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Vision Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Vision rents at a verified 200,000 VND per day in Hanoi, the step-up tier above the entry machines. This guide plans the daily rental around that number: what the rate buys, why this scooter costs more than the entry tier, when the daily rate is the right structure, and when the weekly rate takes over.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, what the Vision is as a machine, day-by-day budget planning, the break-even against the 1,000,000 VND weekly rate and the 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND monthly rate, and the extras, deposit, gear and fuel, that turn a headline rate into a real budget. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified daily price</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">What the Vision buys</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Planning a daily budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The break-even math</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Vision versus other daily rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Deposits, gear and extras</a></li>
